  "source_sha256": "6cb9f5a44d97c0576eafc5a4734631fe122dbdf93834f3d12b2ec2922fc1b723",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "45368826d750a4eb71fcc1bdb36e89f1047999f34e3289ad2943a11224ae3de0",
      "text": "悟空\n尝一小口",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3949e24fa0b36737d93c74e05fe1095a8c280b41b7e4e26ec42aa86c2a289ee1",
      "text": "太阳慢慢落山了。\n悟空抱着他的桃子。\n“我只吃桃子！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "79c44daf3a11f2d6fbd982b0e97e5791df50385d3d725357e73d7b8ffd46ed81",
      "text": "“来帮忙做晚饭吧。”\n八戒说。\n悟空帮忙洗胡萝卜。\n哗啦！鼻子也湿了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5377edf5820c388851618a61bafe7017215abafddd838a456099a9b23d9afc64",
      "text": "沙僧搅着锅里的菜。\n一片叶子落在\n悟空的桃子上。\n“我的桃子戴帽子啦！”\n他咯咯地笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "83355c3a46c94fbbeaf638fc729517a287098643f21a6120fad31deaffae4f3d",
      "text": "一股香味飘过来。\n“那是什么呀？”悟空问。\n“热乎乎的胡萝卜呀。”\n沙僧说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ad6864ac1da088f17410d0138670601ea9c1cfa70ecdb52a63af3cc4af975f34",
      "text": "悟空尝了一小口。\n“哦！又甜又软。”\n他把桃子\n放在碗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "92f0e28b5b4368505327565803f9c5f1c200a965726f6eada14501fd11c112c4",
      "text": "“再尝一口青菜？”\n悟空尝了一小片菜叶。\n“嗯……又软又多汁！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "12ac8a8e2a5902747fe427114afbe5f11f4dd4912b354f554a39df4b4726982a",
      "text": "他尝了米饭，\n还有小块小块的豆腐。\n这个尝一点，\n那个尝一点。\n“我的碗里有新朋友啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "81a4753bcc7fa893661d3a2e92dfa9fcc3ed155123aaaebbfdc616525f49d288",
      "text": "月光洒在餐桌上。\n悟空吃完最后一口桃子。\n“我喜欢的不光是桃子啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "07ba5140d3354541c642fbf1c5428c54f5e4e215546e10f7a7fd036a32166b94",
      "text": "悟空钻进被窝。\n“晚安，小碗。\n晚安，朋友们。”\n明天，他还可以\n尝尝新东西。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "289f1ec520e4ee3afd619415c1cb27295d9ced81c1cf804b8ba097d89c275be2",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n故事与插画使用 AI 辅助创作，由作者指导和编辑。",
